  "schema": "gamma.literal-scale125-stage-freeze.v1",
  "selection_rationale": "Predeclared seven structural families, including six hard problems and three easy problems, selected by low problem ID within declared family slots. No encoding or source outcomes inspected for selection. Metadata difficulty labels are experimenter annotations. This is a bounded development panel, not representative sampling of all LeetCode.",
  "source_policy": "Original plus canonical entrypoint/printing, compact binding names, scope/role names and guarded arrow forms from pinned existing generators. No algorithm replacement. Reject unsupported transforms explicitly. All emitted helpers are inside measured source.",
  "success": "All decoded packets exact; zero oracle/parity discrepancies for accepted variants; improve input or package with all subset regressions visible. Do not discard failures or change caps. No autonomous/generalization claim.",
  "validation": "Hash-check admitted originals and all assigned independent cases. Expected values stay host-side. Candidate must pass original oracle and exact result/type/input-after/alias parity. Finite cases, no maximal complexity claim; AST rewrites retain algorithms. Missing adapters or numeric contracts remain failures in125 denominator."
